        {
          "name": "Arguments",
          "type": "UE::Editor::DataStorage::FMetaDataView&"
        }
      ],
      "returnType": "TSharedPtr<SWidget>",
      "docs": "Calls Construct() to create the internal widget, and then stores it in a container before returning.\nIn most cases you want to call this to first create the initial TEDS widget, to ensure the internal widget is\nautomatically created/destroyed if the row matches/unmatches the required columns.\nConstruct() can be called later to (re)create the internal widget if ever required.\n@see Construct"
    },
